# Hash-locked runtime closure: the container image (Dockerfile) and the
# source-binding / live-probe jobs in .github/workflows/compiler.yml.
# The top-level pins stay in requirements.txt, which mirrors
# [project].dependencies in pyproject.toml. Regenerate runtime.txt whenever
# requirements.txt changes (tests/test_ci_requirements_lock.py fails on drift):
#   uv pip compile --universal --generate-hashes --python-version 3.12 \
#     requirements/ci/runtime.in -o requirements/ci/runtime.txt
-r ../../requirements.txt
